which drives the whole flow conversationally. In Claude Code:",[316,317,322],"pre",{"className":318,"code":320,"language":321},[319],"language-text","\u002Fplugin marketplace add kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\n\u002Fplugin install kinotic@kinotic\n\u002Fkinotic:new-app my-app\n","text",[323,324,320],"code",{"__ignoreMap":325},"",[274,327,328],{},"In Codex (the CLI, the IDE extension, or the ChatGPT desktop app), install the same plugin and ask Codex to create a Kinotic app:",[316,330,334],{"className":331,"code":332,"language":333,"meta":325,"style":325},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","codex plugin marketplace add kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\ncodex plugin add kinotic@kinotic\n","bash",[323,335,336,358],{"__ignoreMap":325},[337,338,341,345,349,352,355],"span",{"class":339,"line":340},"line",1,[337,342,344],{"class":343},"sBMFI","codex",[337,346,348],{"class":347},"sfazB"," plugin",[337,350,351],{"class":347}," marketplace",[337,353,354],{"class":347}," add",[337,356,357],{"class":347}," kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\n",[337,359,361,363,365,367],{"class":339,"line":360},2,[337,362,344],{"class":343},[337,364,348],{"class":347},[337,366,354],{"class":347},[337,368,369],{"class":347}," kinotic@kinotic\n",[274,371,372,373,376],{},"In Grok Build, install it and run ",[323,374,375],{},"\u002Fnew-app my-app",":",[316,378,380],{"className":331,"code":379,"language":333,"meta":325,"style":325},"grok plugin install kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin --trust\n",[323,381,382],{"__ignoreMap":325},[337,383,384,387,389,392,395],{"class":339,"line":340},[337,385,386],{"class":343},"grok",[337,388,348],{"class":347},[337,390,391],{"class":347}," install",[337,393,394],{"class":347}," kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin",[337,396,397],{"class":347}," --trust\n",[274,399,400],{},"You can also create the Application and Project from the Kinotic OS dashboard; either way you end up with a provisioned repository.",[278,402,404],{"id":403